---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import LogoLockup from '../../components/LogoLockup.astro';
import { blogTopics, topicFor, blogTitle, blogDescription } from '../../lib/blog';
const posts = (await getCollection('blog')).sort((a,b) => (b.data.updatedDate ?? b.data.pubDate).valueOf() - (a.data.updatedDate ?? a.data.pubDate).valueOf());
const featured = ['calcular-roi-proyecto-ia-pyme-chile', 'cuaderno-de-campo-digital-vinas-chile', 'por-que-fallan-proyectos-ia-pymes'].map(id => posts.find(post => post.id === id)).filter(Boolean);
const schema = JSON.stringify({ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'CollectionPage', '@id': 'https://appsdelsur.cl/blog/#collection', url: 'https://appsdelsur.cl/blog/', name: blogTitle, description: blogDescription, inLanguage: 'es-CL', mainEntity: { '@type': 'ItemList', itemListElement: posts.map((post, i) => ({ '@type': 'ListItem', position: i + 1, name: post.data.title, url: `https://appsdelsur.cl/blog/${post.id}/` })) } }).replaceAll('<','\\u003c');
---
<Layout title={blogTitle} description={blogDescription} canonical="https://appsdelsur.cl/blog/" ogTitle={blogTitle} ogDescription={blogDescription} omitFaqSchema>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={schema} />
  <header class="blog-nav"><div class="shell"><a href="/" aria-label="Apps del Sur — Inicio"><LogoLockup class="h-14 w-auto" /></a><nav aria-label="Navegación principal"><a href="/enfoque/">Nuestro enfoque</a><a href="/#contacto" class="contact">Conversemos</a></nav></div></header>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="intro shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">EL BLOG DE APPS DEL SUR · CHILE</p>
      <h1>Menos tareas repetidas.<br /><em>Más tiempo para tu negocio.</em></h1>
      <div class="intro-bottom"><p>¿Tu equipo vuelve a escribir lo mismo en Excel, papel y WhatsApp? Aquí encontrarás ideas para ordenar la operación, evaluar la IA y decidir qué vale la pena digitalizar.</p><a href="#lecturas" class="text-link">Encuentra tu próxima lectura <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="featured-band" aria-labelledby="start-title"><div class="shell">
      <div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">PARA EMPEZAR</p><h2 id="start-title">Tres preguntas que abren una buena conversación</h2></div>
      <div class="featured-grid">{featured.map((post,i) => post && <a class="feature" href={`/blog/${post.id}/`}><span class="feature-number" aria-hidden="true">0{i+1}</span><span class="eyebrow">{topicFor(post.id).label}</span><h3>{i===0 ? '¿Vale la pena esta inversión?' : i===1 ? '¿Cuánto costó hoy el trabajo en tu campo?' : '¿Qué revisar antes de empezar con IA?'}</h3><p>{i===0 ? 'Calcula el retorno con tus propios números y compara escenarios.' : i===1 ? 'Del registro en papel al costo por cuartel y por hectárea.' : 'Seis errores que puedes detectar antes de comprar una herramienta.'}</p><span class="feature-link">Leer guía · {post.data.readingTime} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>)}</div>
    </div></section>
    <section id="lecturas" class="shell library" aria-labelledby="library-title">
      <div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">IDEAS PARA LLEVAR A LA PRÁCTICA</p><h2 id="library-title">¿Qué quieres resolver?</h2><p>IA para pymes, automatización, cuaderno de campo y financiamiento para empresas de Chile, con foco en el centro-sur.</p></div>
      <form id="blog-search" role="search"><label for="search">Buscar una guía</label><div class="search-row"><input id="search" type="search" name="q" placeholder="Prueba con costos, WhatsApp o viñas…" autocomplete="off" /><button type="submit">Buscar</button></div></form>
      <nav class="topics" aria-label="Filtrar artículos por tema"><a href="/blog/#lecturas" data-topic="todos" aria-current="true">Todos</a>{blogTopics.map(topic => <a href={`/blog/?tema=${topic.id}#lecturas`} data-topic={topic.id}>{topic.label}</a>)}</nav>
      <p id="results" class="result-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">{posts.length} guías para explorar</p>
      <div class="post-grid">{posts.map(post => <article class="post-card" data-category={topicFor(post.id).id} data-search={`${post.data.title} ${post.data.description} ${post.data.tags.join(' ')}`}><p class="eyebrow">{topicFor(post.id).label}</p><h3><a href={`/blog/${post.id}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h3><p>{post.data.description}</p><div class="post-meta"><span>{post.data.readingTime}</span><time datetime={(post.data.updatedDate ?? post.data.pubDate).toISOString()}>{post.data.updatedDate ? 'Actualizado ' : ''}{(post.data.updatedDate ?? post.data.pubDate).toLocaleDateString('es-CL',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'})}</time></div><a class="text-link" href={`/blog/${post.id}/`} aria-label={`Leer: ${post.data.title}`}>Leer artículo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>)}</div>
      <div id="empty" hidden><h3>No encontramos una guía con esa búsqueda.</h3><p>Prueba con otra palabra o explora todos los temas.</p><button type="button" id="reset-search">Ver todas las guías</button></div>
    </section>
    <section class="about shell" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">DE LA LECTURA A TU OPERACIÓN</p><h2 id="about-title">Conoce Apps del Sur</h2><p>Somos la marca de GYS Activa SpA. Trabajamos en digitalización e IA aplicada a procesos de empresas chilenas. En terreno, nuestro enfoque es el cuaderno de campo digital: registrar labores y entender costos por hectárea.</p><p><strong>No reemplaza su contabilidad. Se conecta con ella y le envía los datos listos.</strong></p><p>También evaluamos opciones CORFO, FIA y Sercotec según las bases y convocatorias vigentes.</p></div><div class="about-actions"><a class="primary" href="/diagnostico-madurez-ia/">Explora tu madurez en IA →</a><a class="text-link" href="/cuaderno-de-campo/">Conoce el cuaderno de campo →</a><a class="text-link" href="/#contacto">Cuéntanos qué necesitas resolver →</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="blog-footer shell"><p><strong>Apps del Sur</strong> · Digitalización, cuaderno de campo e IA aplicada en Chile.</p><nav aria-label="Pie de página"><a href="/">Inicio</a><a href="/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/#contacto">Contacto</a></nav><p>© 2026 GYS Activa SpA.</p></footer>
</Layout>
<script>
  const normalize = (value: string) => value.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').toLowerCase();
  const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#search')!;
  const cards = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.post-card')];
  const links = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('[data-topic]')];
  let topic = 'todos';
  const apply = () => {
    let count=0;
    for(const card of cards) { card.hidden = !((topic === 'todos' || card.dataset.category === topic) && normalize(card.dataset.search ?? '').includes(normalize(input.value.trim()))); if(!card.hidden) count++; }
    links.forEach(link => link.setAttribute('aria-current', String(link.dataset.topic === topic)));
    document.querySelector('#results')!.textContent = `${count} ${count === 1 ? 'guía disponible' : 'guías disponibles'}`;
    (document.querySelector('#empty') as HTMLElement).hidden = count > 0;
    const url = new URL(location.href); topic==='todos' ? url.searchParams.delete('tema') : url.searchParams.set('tema',topic); input.value.trim() ? url.searchParams.set('q',input.value.trim()) : url.searchParams.delete('q'); history.replaceState(null,'',url);
  };
  const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
  if(links.some(link => link.dataset.topic === params.get('tema'))) topic = params.get('tema')!;
  input.value = params.get('q') ?? ''; apply();
  links.forEach(link => link.addEventListener('click', event => { event.preventDefault(); topic=link.dataset.topic!; apply(); }));
  input.addEventListener('input',apply);
  document.querySelector('#blog-search')!.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();apply();});
  document.querySelector('#reset-search')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{topic='todos';input.value='';apply();input.focus();});
</script>
<style>
  .shell{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding-inline:28px}.blog-nav{border-bottom:1px solid #dce5df;background:#fff}.blog-nav .shell{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;min-height:80px}.blog-nav nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;font-size:14px}.contact,.primary{background:#144d3d;color:white;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block}main{background:#fbfcf8;color:#213c32}.intro{padding-top:76px;padding-bottom:64px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;color:#386c53}.intro h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(38px,5.5vw,68px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:22px 0 30px;font-weight:400}.intro em{color:#397659}.intro-bottom{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px}.intro-bottom p{max-width:630px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#53675c}.text-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#225d45;display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:44px}.featured-band{background:#eaf0e4;border-block:1px solid #d7e2d1;padding-block:42px 52px}.section-title h2,.about h2{font:400 32px/1.2 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:12px 0 18px}.section-title>p:last-child{max-width:640px;color:#53675c;line-height:1.7}.featured-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:30px}.feature{position:relative;padding:34px 26px 26px;background:#fbfcf8;border:1px solid #d5dfce;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .2s}.feature:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.feature-number{font:italic 48px Georgia,serif;color:#bacbb0;margin-bottom:24px}.feature h3{font:400 25px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:14px 0}.feature p{color:#53675c;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;flex:1}.feature-link{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:24px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.library{padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;scroll-margin-top:24px}form{max-width:660px;margin:30px 0 22px}label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}.search-row{display:flex;gap:8px}input{background:white;border:1px solid #8b9f8f;min-width:0;flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:4px}.search-row button,#reset-search{background:#144d3d;color:white;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:4px}.topics{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}.topics a{padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #bacbbd;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;background:white}.topics a[aria-current=true]{background:#144d3d;border-color:#144d3d;color:white}.result-count{color:#68776c;font-size:13px;margin:25px 0}.post-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0 42px}.post-card{border-top:1px solid #cbd7ca;padding:28px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.post-card[hidden],[hidden]{display:none!important}.post-card h3{font:400 25px/1.25 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.post-card>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;color:#53675c;line-height:1.7;flex:1}.post-card h3 a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px}.post-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:#68776c;margin:20px 0 8px}.about{background:#eaf0e4;padding-block:42px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:60px;margin-bottom:50px}.about p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:14px 0;color:#53675c}.about-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;justify-content:center;gap:16px}.blog-footer{padding-block:30px 40px;border-top:1px solid #dce5df;font-size:12px;color:#53675c;display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between}.blog-footer nav{display:flex;gap:20px}:is(a,button,input):focus-visible{outline:3px solid #976b28;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:700px){.shell{padding-inline:20px}.intro{padding-top:42px;padding-bottom:42px}.intro-bottom{display:block}.intro-bottom .text-link{margin-top:18px}.featured-grid,.post-grid,.about{grid-template-columns:1fr}.featured-grid{gap:16px}.feature{padding:22px}.feature-number{font-size:34px;margin-bottom:12px}.about{gap:22px;margin-inline:20px}.blog-nav nav{gap:12px}.blog-nav nav>a:first-child{display:none}.section-title h2{font-size:28px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.feature{transition:none}.feature:hover{transform:none}}
</style>
